d":"cbf4dfd8-0ab7-4b83-b754-a810e7ecf100","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（Gina、ありすえさん的には保守が大変そうだからGinにめっちゃ期待してる）","ts":"1621326039.005900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1TSZ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8731fc3c-0941-44fc-956d-cc22618b7617","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`:h gina-custom-command`","ts":"1621325709.005400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJVQ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42c9574e-edf0-4d3d-ab0b-2e000f4f89a4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いけた","ts":"1621325668.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+YXi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5dffbbe-4d08-4261-9212-732de7331130","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`call gina#custom#command#option('log', '--opener', 'botright 100vsplit')`","ts":"1621325667.004900","thread_ts":"1621325667.004900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1621325679.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e52f530a-5e60-4e17-a1b2-1c57064fdc53","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"vimの+cmdと++optはつけられるらしい","ts":"1621325622.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bZP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8ddfe09-c2ef-4e05-a823-8bb685dc2a57","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```\t\t\t\t\t\t*gina-buffer-+cmd*\nWhen a buffer is opend by gina, [+cmd] specified to the command is recognized\nand performed. See \":h +cmd\" for the detail.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t*gina-buffer-++opt*\nWhen a buffer is opend by gina, [++opt] specified to the command is recognized\nand respected. Users can use this feature to open a buffer with a particular\nencoding or format like\n\u0026gt;\n\t:Gina show ++enc=sjis ++ff=mac HEAD:README.md\n\t\" --\u0026gt; Open README.md in HEAD with sjis/mac\n\u0026lt;\nSee \":h ++opt\" for more detail.```","ts":"1621325611.004400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W4Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fff321d0-ccb3-4c92-9645-89a83fb0dfe4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```:Gina log [+cmd] [++opt] [{options}] [{treeish}] [-- {pathspec}...]\n\tOpen a \"gina-log\" buffer to show commits of the {treeish} or the\n\trepository.\n\tIf {path} part of the {treeish} is missing, it shows a log of the\n\trepository.\n\n\tThe followings are allowed in {options} additional to options for\n\ta corresponding git command.\n\n\t--group={group}\n\t\tA window group name used for the buffer (|gina-options-group|)\n\t--opener={opener}\n\t\tAn opener command for the new buffer (|gina-options-opener|)\n\n\tSee also~\n\t|gina-buffer-log|\n\t:!man git-log```","ts":"1621325568.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A3N2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"222ac0a9-6cbb-48d9-bdf2-5d50815e49a5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ginaってオプションつけ放題じゃないですっけ","ts":"1621325355.003800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TK2j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3444260-5d96-4d20-b5f9-e0f17ef52688","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"gina log、デフォルトはカレントバッファじゃないっけな","ts":"1621324936.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/4S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3c74720-e8f4-483a-9576-ee5a447c4a09","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"gina log開いたときにウィンドウサイズも自動調整したいんだけどいい方法ないかなぁ","ts":"1621324882.003000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5DKOi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f22bfe4-e883-48ec-8534-50e747a80a0a","type":"message","u